        "original_id": "341a9387-36d7-5863-ae98-123a84458e66",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pinocchio (1940 film), Home on the Range (2004 film), \"I've Got No Strings\"\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures\n- People: Carlo Collodi, Dickie Jones\n- Concepts: The Adventures of Pinocchio, Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs\n\nFacts:\n- Pinocchio is a 1940 American animated musical fantasy film produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Pinocchio is based on the Italian children's novel The Adventures of Pinocchio by Carlo Collodi.\n- Pinocchio was the second animated feature film produced by Disney after the success of Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs (1937).\n- Home on the Range is a 2004 American animated musical western comedy film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation.\n- Home on the Range was released by Walt Disney Pictures.\n- \"I've Got No Strings,\" also known as \"I Got No Strings,\" is a song from Walt Disney's animated film Pinocchio.\n- Dickie Jones sang \"I've Got No Strings\" as Pinocchio.",
